# ERSPAN sensor suppressions, read by Suricata as /etc/suricata/threshold.config.
# Each entry is measured noise; keep the evidence with it and scope by source when possible.
# Suppressed events are not logged at all. Remove a line and restart capture to restore it.

# 2026-11-21: 35% of all alerts. The OTel SNMP receiver on k3s-worker-macmini-1
# (192.168.13.12) polls HomeSwitch01/02/04 and 192.168.3.16 on udp/161 with
# community "public" every scrape. SNMP-public from any other source still alerts.
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2101411, track by_src, ip 192.168.13.12

# 2026-11-21: 23% each. Stream-engine anomalies from one-sided or duplicated mirror
# copies (ingress-only sessions; flows seen on two VLANs), mostly LAN management
# sessions (Proxmox 8006, UniFi 11443, IDS ingest 30445). Not attack signals here.
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2210045
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2210046
